== What is actually at stake, in megawatts

The whole EU-27 government estate modelled here comes to roughly 306 MW of design load
and EUR 7.2 bn of capital. That is small. It is roughly one large commercial campus,
spread across twenty-seven countries. The number matters because the debate is conducted
as though sovereignty were unaffordable, and at this scale it plainly is not.

